@startuml Header 路由:网关无需解析 body
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowparam false
skinparam shadow false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #7A93BE
  BorderThickness 1
  FontColor #1F2933
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6
  BorderColor #E0B400
  FontColor #5C4A00
  FontSize 10
}

title Header 路由:网关只看 header,不解析 body

' ===== 旧:必须解析 body 才能路由 =====
rectangle "**有状态(旧):网关必须深度解析**" as old #FFE8E8;line:Dashed {
  rectangle "Gateway" as g1 #FFFFFF
  note right of g1
    1. 读完整 HTTP body
    2. JSON 解析
    3. 提取 session_id
    4. 按 session_id 路由
    —— 慢、重、易出错
  end note
}

' ===== 新:只看 header 即可路由 =====
rectangle "**无状态(新):只看 Header**" as new #DDF3E4;line:Dashed {
  rectangle "Gateway" as g2 #FFFFFF
  note right of g2
    Mcp-Method: tools/call
    Mcp-Name: search
    —— 直接用 header 路由
    body 原封不动转发
  end note
}

old -[hidden]right-> new

note bottom of new
  <b>收益</b>
  - WAF / 限流器 / 鉴权层零成本接入
  - 无需定制 JSON 解析中间件
  - 网关性能:微秒级路由,无需反序列化
end note

@enduml
